 "notes": "Level_24 — Coyote + gates\n\nChapter 3 · Coyote + gates. Target difficulty 6.5/10.\n\nA fence runs the full width of the field with a single gate in it, so the gate is the only way south to the coops. The coyote paces the lane directly below that fence.\n\nThe interaction is the point: the gate is hinged on its right corner, so shoving it south swings it down into the coyote's lane and cuts the patrol in two. Open the way and you have also shortened the animal guarding it.\n\nShortest solution: 27 steps (LLLLLRLRRRRRRLLRRRLLRRRLRLL).",
